docs {
  # Update Article Status
  
  Updates an article's status to `published` and automatically enqueues its translation for vector ingestion.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description              |
  |-----------|------|----------|--------------------------|
  | id        | uuid | Yes      | The article's UUID       |
  
  ## Success Response (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Article updated successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "contentType": "article",
      "topic": "malaria",
      "authorId": "uuid",
      "status": "published",
      "createdAt": "date",
      "updatedAt": "date"
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid"
    }
  }
  ```
}
